<view class="tech-page pool-detail"><view class="tech-head"><view><view class="tech-title">接单详情</view><view class="tech-subtitle">先了解任务，再确认是否接单</view></view></view><view wx:if="{{pendingLabel}}" class="tech-notice"><van-icon name="info-o" /><view>上次接单结果待确认<button class="tech-link" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="onRetry">{{busy?'正在确认…':'恢复原操作'}}</button></view></view><tech-state wx:if="{{loading}}" loading /><tech-state wx:elif="{{error}}" error title="订单当前不可读取" description="{{error}}" action="重新读取" bind:retry="load" /><block wx:elif="{{entry}}"><view class="tech-card pool-summary"><text class="tech-tag">平台已核对 · 可自主接单</text><view class="pool-title">{{title}}维修</view><view class="pool-no">{{entry.workOrderNo}}</view><view class="pool-label">故障摘要</view><view class="pool-description">{{entry.symptomSummary}}</view><view class="pool-label">服务区域</view><view class="pool-description"><van-icon name="location-o" /> {{entry.serviceAreaText||'区域待平台核实'}}</view><view class="pool-slot-confirm"><view class="pool-label">用户期望上门时段</view><view class="pool-description"><van-icon name="calendar-o" /> {{slotText}}</view><text>确认接单，即同意按该时段上门</text></view><view class="pool-time">{{timeText}} 发布</view></view><view class="tech-section"><text class="tech-section__title">接单后如何服务</text></view><view class="tech-card pool-flow"><view><text>01</text>核对时段，接单即确认预约</view><view><text>02</text>现场检测，按规则报价</view><view><text>03</text>客户确认后维修，完工后验收</view></view><view class="tech-notice tech-notice--blue"><van-icon name="shield-o" /><text>客户联系方式、详细地址与照片仅在抢中并持有当前有效任务后开放。请按实际服务能力接单，勿代抢或重复提交。</text></view></block><view wx:if="{{commandError}}" class="tech-form-error">{{commandError}}</view><view wx:if="{{entry}}" class="tech-dock"><button class="tech-btn tech-btn--primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy||!!pendingLabel||!canClaim}}" bindtap="onClaim">确认时段并接单</button></view></view>
